    "title": "Everything You Need to Know About Applying to University of Hawaii at Manoa",
    "text": "University of Hawaii at Manoa has an acceptance rate of 87%. Half the applicants admitted to University of Hawaii--Manoa who submitted test scores have an SAT score between 1081 and 1293 or an ACT score of 17 and 25. However, one quarter of admitted applicants achieved scores above these ranges and one quarter scored below these ranges. The application deadline at University of Hawaii at Manoa is rolling. Admissions officials at University of Hawaii at Manoa consider a student's GPA a very important academic factor. An applicant's high school class rank and letters of recommendation, when available, are considered by admissions officials at University of Hawaii at Manoa. To see additional academic factors along with other school data, learn more about College Compass. University of Hawaii--Manoa Admissions Statsapplication deadlinerollingWill You Get Into University of Hawaii at Manoa?College Admissions CalculatorSee How You CompareSign up for a free U.S. News account to see how you stack up against applicants seeking admission at any school.Already have an account?Log in now.InterestedInterestedAppliedAppliedAcceptedAcceptedEnrolledEnrolledRejectedRejectedWaitlistedWaitlistedSee How You CompareSign up for a free U.S. News account to see how you stack up against applicants seeking admission at any school.Already have an account?Log in now.InterestedInterestedAppliedAppliedAcceptedAcceptedEnrolledEnrolledRejectedRejectedWaitlistedWaitlistedData provided by U.S. News College Compass Users.University of Hawaii at Manoa Admissions RequirementsRequired Standardized TestsRecommendedSAT/ACT Scores Must Be Received ByMarch 1University of Hawaii at Manoa ApplicationsApplication DeadlinerollingEarly Decision DeadlineN/ACommon Application AcceptedN/ADeadline for housing depositN/APriority application deadlineEntering Class StatsEarly Decision Acceptance RateN/AEarly action acceptance rateAcceptance rate (excluding early action and early decision students)Transfer 